      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふむふむ。なるほど。
筋力ばかりでは成り立たない
技量的な割合が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmhmhm. I see. You've developed a
great deal of skill that's impossible
for one focusing on muscles alone...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……となるとやはり
トレーニングではあっちの
プログラムのほうが有効か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...In that case, that training
program in particular
should be most effective...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……………………………………
……………………………ほほう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Very interesting.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271352</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ瞬発力の割合を
持たせることで相乗効果を
期待できるはずだけど…………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then if I increase my muscles'
instant strength output, I should
achieve the best synergy, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
