      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ん？　ああ、そうか。
ごめんごめん。
つい見入っちゃったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? Oh, right.
Sorry, sorry. I
got a bit fixated.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ報酬を、と……
……君たちにはＧの記憶が
ふさわしいかな……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, your reward...
...Maybe the Memory of
G would be a good fit...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
