      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うおっ！
こ、これは！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa! Th-This is...!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271788</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだか力と、そして
重みを感じる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Somehow, it feels really
powerful...and heavy, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271876</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なあ！
いいの？こんなスゴそうなの
もらっちゃって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>H-Hey! You sure you're cool with
this? Like, you're really just gonna
give us something this awesome?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……じゃあやっぱり一人で
訓練するより複数、いや二人で
なんとか…………………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Then rather than train alone,
a group...or no, maybe two
people would be better...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>き、聞いちゃいねー……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>H-He's not listening...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
